\newlabel{fig:fates}{{14}{13}{What happened to transferred requests: totals over 30 nights, as shares of each rule's transfers (n). Each row reconciles: transfers = Lyft completed + Lyft no-show + cancelled in the lag + cancelled after the Lyft was ordered \SIM . ``Vans only'' makes no transfers and is omitted}{figure.caption.25}{}}
